{"id":"b3f39618ac65ba2c","group":"89","path":"89/89-fact-gl-no-reflexive.md","title":"fact-gl-no-reflexive — GL Excludes Reflexive Frames","display":"fact-gl-no-reflexive — GL Excludes Reflexive Frames","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-fact-gl-no-reflexive","aliases":["89-fact-gl-no-reflexive"],"display":"fact-gl-no-reflexive — GL Excludes Reflexive Frames","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-frame]]","[[89-df-reflexive-frame]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-fact-gl-no-reflexive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-fact-gl-no-reflexive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-gl-no-reflexive — GL Excludes Reflexive Frames"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2645a0212ae48293\" href=\"?note=2645a0212ae48293\" title=\"89-df-reflexive-frame\">89-df-reflexive-frame</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F=(W,R)\">\\(\\mathcal F=(W,R)\\)</span> is a nonempty Kripke frame.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLFrame}(\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{GLFrame}(\\mathcal F)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Refl}(\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Refl}(\\mathcal F)\\)</span> are the GL-frame and reflexivity predicates.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}gl\\text{-}no\\text{-}reflexive}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLFrame}(\\mathcal F)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{Refl}(\\mathcal F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}gl\\text{-}no\\text{-}reflexive}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLFrame}(\\mathcal F)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{Refl}(\\mathcal F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> : GL逻辑 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p \\rightarrow p\">\\(\\Box p \\rightarrow p\\)</span> : T公理（自反性）</li>\n<li>GL不包含T公理</li>\n<li>证明：逆良基性应用于单点集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{w\\}\">\\(\\{w\\}\\)</span>，排除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wRw\">\\(wRw\\)</span>；W 非空，故 R 不可能在整个 W 上自反。</li>\n<li>算术解释下须区分外部可靠性与内部反射可证性。标准 PA 所证的句子在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 中为真；GL 不含 T 模式表示这种反射不能一般由 PA 在自身内部证明。</li>\n<li>来源：Boolos，第 3 章 pp.62–64、第 4 章 pp.74–77；印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-reflexive-frame","status":"resolved","id":"2645a0212ae48293","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-reflexive-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GL}$ : GL逻辑 (see [[89-df-gl-logic]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F=(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLFrame}(\\mathcal F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Refl}(\\mathcal F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}gl\\text{-}no\\text{-}reflexive}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLFrame}(\\mathcal F)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{Refl}(\\mathcal F).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box p \\rightarrow p","display":false},{"tex":"\\{w\\}","display":false},{"tex":"wRw","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false}],"bytes":1260,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-566","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-fact-gl-no-reflexive]]"}],"outgoing":["c6ab46cd662b1409","2645a0212ae48293","0006800fa1c85177"]}